  峰 5: 1/F₄=0.333  峰 7: 1/F₅=0.200
    j=1: F_1=1, 1/F_1=1.00000
    j=2: F_2=1, 1/F_2=1.00000
    j=3: F_3=2, 1/F_3=0.50000
    j=4: F_4=3, 1/F_4=0.33333
    j=5: F_5=5, 1/F_5=0.20000

